      "score": 649,
      "comments": 359,
      "author": "etoxin",
      "published": "2026-08-10T06:02:38Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Docker Sandboxes secure infrastructure by executing untrusted, LLM-generated code within ephemeral, isolated container runtimes.",
        "Implements strict resource limits, filesystem isolation, and rapid teardown to prevent prompt injection exploits from compromising host networks.",
        "Streamlines DevOps orchestration by offering programmatic APIs to dynamically spawn and destroy lightweight execution environments for AI workloads."
      ]
    },
